<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Create_new_soundset">Create new soundset</span></h2>
<p>Temptate is located in _Core Soundsets. Duplicate soundset_template_party.dlg into your own file name the new file name should start with ss_ to clearly identify it as a soundset. For example: ss_sirene.
Next step- write line you want character say in Owner like you do it for Conversation.
The last- add your soundset to the character in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Character" title="Character">Character</a> character resource type. In section 
</p>
